cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this bench, cite the repository and the model papers it is built on."
title: "aaps-insilico: in-silico test bench for AndroidAPS + autoISF"
abstract: >-
  Closed-loop test bench that runs the real AndroidAPS autoISF algorithm code against a
  UVA/Padova-like virtual cohort, with CGM lag/noise, exercise, pump limits and fault injection.
  It is not a clinical tool and not an FDA-adopted population; output is a comparison of algorithm
  variants under identical scenarios.
type: software
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
